ree is an interval of positions, and any path between two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertices is at most 2⌊log₂ n⌋ + 1 intervals (","type":"text"},{"code":"segments(from:to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), for path and subtree","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"queries over a structure indexed by position.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/documentation\/TreeAlgorithms\/HeavyLightDecomposition","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HeavyLightDecomposition"}]},"doc://TreeAlgorithms/documentation/TreeAlgorithms/Trees":{"type":"topic","title":"Trees","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/treealgorithms\/trees","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/documentation\/TreeAlgorithms\/Trees"},"doc://TreeAlgorithms/documentation/TreeAlgorithms/LowestCommonAncestors":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/documentation\/TreeAlgorithms\/LowestCommonAncestors","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"LowestCommonAncestors","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LowestCommonAncestors","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"LowestCommonAncestors","url":"\/documentation\/treealgorithms\/lowestcommonancestors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Lowest common ancestors of a rooted tree or arborescence, each in O(1) after O(n) work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(NetworkX "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lowest_common_ancestor"},{"type":"text","text":", JGraphT’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LowestCommonAncestorAlgorithm"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}